<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE-PolyGram H1 net dips slightly.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PolyGram H1 net dips slightly.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.50 vs   1.51</p>
<p>    Net profit			   270    vs 272</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  4.53 vs   4.31</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected PolyGram to report a net profit of flat to as much as 286 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		   430    vs 420</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    4    vs   6</p>
<p>    Tax				    124    vs 124</p>
<p>    Share of associates losses	20    vs  16</p>
<p>    Minorities share of profit	12    vs   2</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
